16
00:02:02.570 --> 00:02:05.990
Kušliga on juba vene, 10 km kaugusel.

17
00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:10.350
Kušliga on juba vene ema Vassiljeva.

18
00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.860
Šokša ja mina olen Veps,

19
00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:18.920
